msgstr "Syslog %s iestatījumi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What uninstall method do you want to use?"
msgstr "Kādu atinstalēšanas metodi vēlaties izmantot?"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When uninstalling syslog, you can remove everything, or only components, just in case you plan on re-installing in the future."
msgstr "Atinstalējot syslog, varat noņemt visu vai tikai komponentus, ja nākotnē plānojat to instalēt atkārtoti."

